%!PS
% Test content for process.ps: six steps, the key step first, a path back
% between neighbours; poster theme (light). `psanim check process-bread.ps`
% runs process.ps with it.
/tpl (process.ps) component
/film /tpl << /Params <<
  /look /poster
  /heading (A loaf of bread)
  /steps [
    [ (mix) (Flour, water, salt and yeast become a rough dough.) ]
    [ (knead) (Stretching and folding builds the gluten.) ]
    [ (rise) (The dough doubles in a warm place.) ]
    [ (shape) (It is folded into a tight loaf.) ]
    [ (proof) (A second, shorter rise in the tin.) ]
    [ (bake) (Forty minutes in a hot oven.) ]
  ]
  /key 0
  /why (Too little water at the start and nothing later can fix it.)
  /loop [ 4 3 (not ready) (If the loaf will not hold its shape, fold it again.) ]
  /summary (Most of baking is waiting; the mixing decides the bread.)
>> >> instance
<< /Size [1280 720] /Duration /film componentduration /FPS 30 >> animation
/scene { /film << /After /hold >> place } def
